<rules>
Fail if ANY of these are true:

GOAL & COVERAGE
- section.goal is not met
- ANY item in section.talkingPoints is missing (must appear clearly in sectionMarkdown)

ROLE & STRUCTURE
- role-specific rules are violated
- heading rules are violated (missing heading when required, or heading does not match section.heading when required)
- meta language appears (e.g. "this article", "this section", "below", "in the next sections")

WORD BUDGET RULE
- section's word count should not exceed word budget

KEYWORDS
- Any keyword in section.keywords[] is not satisfied per <keyword_rules>

LINKS & PRODUCTS
- link rules are violated
- products are mentioned in disallowed roles
- product name appears without first-link where allowed/required by your rules

FACTUAL & DEFENSIBILITY
- invented facts, tests, certifications, endorsements, results, or hard promises appear
- professional endorsements appear unless explicitly supported by context.referenceMaterial

FORMATTING & STYLE
- more than one bullet/numbered list appears total
- nested lists appear
- list items are long paragraphs instead of scannable points

REPETITION
- The section repeats a point already made in draftSoFar
  AND does NOT add a new angle, detail, clarification, or example
</rules>
